            <ArticleTitle>Comment on &quot;Efficacy and adverse events of cold vs hot polypectomy: A meta-analysis&quot;.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6007-6008</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3748/wjg.v23.i32.6007</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a comment on a meta-analysis of published studies comparing cold vs hot polypectomy. We believe that the conclusion of this meta-analysis that &quot;cold polypectomy is a time-saving procedure for removing small polyps with markedly similar curability and safety to hot polypectomy&quot; needs more rigorous evidence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
